{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12334","headline":"县中池竹言怀 · 钱起","name":"县中池竹言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官小志已足，时清免负薪。\n卑栖且得地，荣耀不关身。\n自爱赏心处，丛篁流水滨。\n荷香度高枕，山色满南邻。\n道在即爲乐，机忘宁厌贫。\n却愁丹凤诏，来访漆园人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}